+## Platform layers
+
+| Layer | What this model does there |
+|---|---|
+| **Fusion** | One of seven anomaly voters; its score is combined by the confidence-weighted fusion rule |
+| **Hermes** | anomaly tool - contributes a boundary verdict rather than a forecasting one |
+| **Fallback** | Falls back to m14-isolation-forest when torch is absent |
+| **Drift** | A slow drift of the encoder's mean distance is a hygiene signal that the healthy reference has gone stale |
+
+Layers are described once, in the catalog, and referenced by every model that participates in them: fusion, calibrated uncertainty, drift and data trust, explainability, physics constraints, the safety gate, the evaluation protocol and the Hermes agent.
